WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.425
Coding Exercise 6 brings the entire module together
in one CASE expression

00:00:05.312 --> 00:00:09.438
The highest-priority rule is Do not contact for
inactive records or explicit

00:00:09.462 --> 00:00:15.188
refusal Put that first Next comes the specific
Urgent rule active

00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:20.838
explicit consent high severity and no usable email
Then the broader Routine

00:00:20.862 --> 00:00:24.600
rule covers active patients with explicit consent
who did not match Urgent

00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:31.088
Everything else becomes Review Branch order matters
If Routine comes

00:00:31.112 --> 00:00:36.675
before Urgent the urgent branch becomes unreachable
for consenting active patients The

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:42.350
exercise also requires NULL-aware email handling
Blank and whitespace-only email should

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.500
count as unavailable
